   },
   "box": {
    "x": 22,
    "y": 335,
    "w": 208,
    "h": 191
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The G-Force is designed to break the gas slugs and separate the gas through the backside before it reaches the pump. The encapsulated shroud prevents the fluid to go directly into the pump intake as well as forces the fluid to pass through the separator, ultimately only allowing gas in solution fluid to go into the pump. This allows the operator to build a temporal sump that gives enough retention time to change the flow regime and optimize the pump performance reducing the amount of free gas ingested by the pump.",
   "box": {
    "x": 675,
    "y": 371,
    "w": 642,
    "h": 168
   }
  },
